We have to have
Ran-san's permission.

21:06.780 --> 21:09.450
My sister founded this festival!

21:09.450 --> 21:10.850
But...

21:10.850 --> 21:13.120
-Raise the sound level immediately!
-Yes!

21:13.120 --> 21:15.620
So that girl's gonna be dropped?

21:15.620 --> 21:17.290
Well, that's the rumor.

21:17.290 --> 21:19.620
Hey, the rain's letting up.

21:19.620 --> 21:21.610
Maybe it'll clear up.

21:22.890 --> 21:24.190
Running over sometimes

21:22.890 --> 21:24.190
What's that?!

21:24.190 --> 21:26.960
Running over sometimes

21:26.960 --> 21:30.130
Feel like you leave me behind

21:31.130 --> 21:35.710
Now you don't have to mind it

21:31.130 --> 21:35.710
Koyuki-kun...
The big stage suits you.

21:35.710 --> 21:39.810
Find you shining, everyday by day

21:39.810 --> 21:40.970
Sing it up...

21:42.810 --> 21:44.820
Sorry, girls!

21:44.820 --> 21:48.320
Okay, this long wait
is all under the bridge!

21:48.320 --> 21:50.220
Let's go!

21:54.830 --> 21:56.490
Isn't Stage 3 far?

21:56.490 --> 21:58.720
We have to run to catch
the rest of the performance!

22:09.670 --> 22:11.680
Can you see that
people are leaving?

22:11.680 --> 22:14.680
Yes...the power
of music is awesome.

22:14.680 --> 22:18.350
So many people...and they're
heading for the third stage.

22:18.350 --> 22:22.680
It just means that
Grateful Sound isn't dead.

22:31.530 --> 22:34.200
This next song will be our final one.

22:34.200 --> 22:36.830
I'm going to sing my heart
out for all that's happened.

22:37.800 --> 22:40.700
For BECK, this is...

22:43.540 --> 22:48.910
Full moon sways

22:50.380 --> 22:56.390
Gently in the night of one fine day

22:56.390 --> 22:59.090
What a fool

22:59.090 --> 23:02.560
I don't know 'bout tomorrow

23:02.560 --> 23:07.400
What it's like to be

23:07.400 --> 23:09.390
Ah...

23:10.570 --> 23:12.400
I was fool

23:12.400 --> 23:16.570
Couldn't let myself to go

23:16.570 --> 23:21.340
Even though I feel

23:21.340 --> 23:27.250
The end

23:46.200 --> 23:51.730
Full moon sways

23:53.040 --> 24:00.070
Smiling in my arms for all those years

24:14.000 --> 24:16.170
In the night sky after the rain,
a star shines bright.

24:16.170 --> 24:19.170
Next week! Slip Out.

24:19.170 --> 24:21.670
Go get 'em!
